gonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;startArrow=ERzeroToMany;endArrow=ERzeroToOne;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=10;endSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t_audit_log_employee_id" target="t_employee_id"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1800" y="1032.0"/><mxPoint x="1800" y="96.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="r19" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;startArrow=ERzeroToMany;endArrow=ERzeroToOne;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=10;endSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t_audit_log_object_employee_id" target="t_employee_id"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1820" y="1136.0"/><mxPoint x="1820" y="96.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="note1" value="&lt;b&gt;Giá trị trạng thái&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;account.status: PENDING_OPEN, ACTIVE, BLOCKED, DORMANT, CLOSED&lt;br&gt;ticket.type: MO_TAI_KHOAN, PHONG_TOA, GO_PHONG_TOA, DONG_TAI_KHOAN, MO_TK_THEO_LO&lt;br&gt;ticket.status: PENDING_APPROVAL, REJECTED, APPROVED, COMPLETED, CANCELLED&lt;br&gt;employee.status: ACTIVE, LOCKED (Chờ cấp quyền = chưa có role trong KeyCloak)&lt;br&gt;import_batch.status: CHECKING, CHECKED, SUBMITTED&lt;br&gt;import_batch_row.result: VALID, ERROR, EXCLUDED, CREATED&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ghi chú&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tất cả bảng nằm trong schema app. Bảng của Camunda nằm ở schema riêng, do Camunda tự tạo.&lt;br&gt;Role nhân viên chỉ lưu ở KeyCloak, không có bảng role.&lt;br&gt;account_number và ticket.code sinh bằng Sequence.&lt;br&gt;last_transaction_at lấy từ dữ liệu mẫu (giả lập core banking).&lt;br&gt;Index: cccd, account_number, account.status, ticket.status.&lt;br&gt;QT-03: index UNIQUE trên ticket.account_id WHERE status IN (PENDING_APPROVAL, REJECTED), mỗi tài khoản chỉ 1 phiếu đang mở." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1000" width="380" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>